==French==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|fr|fro|froit}}, {{m|fro|freid}}, inherited from {{inh|fr|la|frīgidus||cold}} (through a syncopated {{inh|fr|VL.|-}} or {{inh|fr|LL.|-}} form {{m|la|frigdus}}, {{m|la||fricdus}}, attested in the Appendix Probi, or {{m|la|fridus}}, on a Pompeian inscription). {{doublet|fr|frigide}}, a later borrowing.

